      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "217 cases of chronic bronchitis and asthma were clinically treated and analyzed for the effects of combining electric stimulation with topical application of drug on acupoints. The results suggested that the combined therapy was superior to unitary therapy (P < 0.05). It is indicated that the combined therapy has a good curative effect in both short- and long-terms."},
